    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Herbert and Lansdowne estate agents present a superb opportunity to acquire a beautifully refurbished one-bedroom apartment in the highly sought-after Malthouse development on Marrowbone Lane, Dublin 8. Extending to approximately 54 sq. m. this stylish one bedroom apartment has been refurbished throughout and is presented in excellent condition, offering a contemporary and comfortable living space in a convenient city-centre location.\r\nThe property comprises a welcoming entrance hall, bright and well-proportioned living accommodation, a modern kitchen, generous double bedroom and a new contemporary bathroom finished to a high standard. The apartment also benefits from a private balcony, providing an excellent outdoor space and an ideal spot to relax or entertain and a secure parking space.\r\n\r\nLocated on Marrowbone Lane, the Malthouse is within easy reach of Dublin city centre and benefits from an excellent selection of local amenities, cafés, restaurants and transport links. The area also offers convenient access to Christchurch, The Liberties, St. Stephen’s Green and the wider city centre.\r\nSize: Approx: 54 square meters\r\nHeating: Electric Heating\r\nManagement fee: €2139 per annum RF Property management\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: The above particulars are issued by Herbert & Lansdowne Estate Agents on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Please note that we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
